<BaseLayout title="About TechPilot AI" description="Learn about TechPilot AI's mission to make artificial intelligence and technology easier to understand.">
  <section class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">About us</span><h1>Technology should feel <span style="color:var(--mint)">more approachable.</span></h1><p>TechPilot AI is being built to help readers make sense of AI tools and everyday technology through clear explanations, useful tutorials, and thoughtful comparisons.</p></section>
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Our mission</h2><p>Our goal is to turn confusing technology topics into practical information people can use. We focus on the real task behind a tool: what it helps you do, how to get started, and what you should consider before using it.</p>
    <h2>How we aim to work</h2><ul><li><strong>Clarity:</strong> explain technical ideas in plain English.</li><li><strong>Practicality:</strong> prioritize steps and examples over hype.</li><li><strong>Transparency:</strong> acknowledge limitations, uncertainty, and changing features.</li><li><strong>Responsible use:</strong> encourage readers to protect private information and verify important outputs.</li></ul>
    <h2>Editorial independence</h2><p>Our aim is to provide useful, reader-focused information. Any future sponsorships, affiliate relationships, or other commercial relationships should be disclosed clearly where relevant. A mention of a product should not be treated as a guarantee or endorsement by its provider.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>Have a correction, suggestion, or topic request? Visit our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
